### R135 BOT_ADDED_INTRO
👋 Hi, I'm *MatchTime*. I take care of the weekly admin for football groups, right here in WhatsApp:

✅ *Who's in:* just say *In* or *Out*. I keep the list and tick your message.
🪑 *The bench:* once you're full, anyone who says *In* late goes on the bench, and the bench gets first dibs if someone drops.
📣 *Chasing:* short of players? I remind the group, and stop once you're full.
⚖️ *Fair teams:* tag me and I pick balanced teams from player ratings.
⭐ *Ratings and Man of the Match* after every game.
📊 *Stats:* ask me anything, and everyone gets their own stats page.
💷 *Match fees:* card or bank pay links, if you want them.

I stay quiet during the banter and only reply to In, Out or a tag.

*Want me to run this group?* Whoever organises it, reply *YES* and I'll ask two quick questions. Not for you? Ignore me and I'll stay quiet. 🤐

### R141 buildHowToUseMe / everything on
✅ Say *"In"* or *"Out"* to mark your own availability, no need to tag me.
🤔 Not sure? Just say *"maybe"* and I'll check with you ~24h before.
💬 Tag *@Match Time* when you want me to do or tell you something:
   • see who's in / how many we've got
   • make / show the teams
   • who won last week? / past stats
🤐 I stay quiet the rest of the time: banter and jokes are safe, I won't butt in.
🏆 After the game I'll run a quick *Man of the Match* vote.
⭐ I'll DM you a one-tap *rating* link after the match.
⏰ Need a nudge? Tag me and say when, in your own words (for example *"@Match Time remind me Thursday"*), and I'll DM you then.
💳 I keep track of who's *paid*.

Type *"@Match Time help"* any time to see this again.

