### R142 buildHelpReply / availability
⚽ *Squad & availability: how it works*
Just say *In* or *Out* in the group to mark yourself for the next game. No need to tag me, I read it automatically.
I keep a live, numbered squad list. When it's full, extra players go on the *bench* in order. Not sure yet? Say *"maybe"* and I'll DM you ~24h before kick-off for a final answer.
If you drop out, I can nudge the bench to step in so we're never short. Say *Out* any time and I'll sort the rest.

✅ It's on for this club.

### R142 buildHelpReply / teams
🟥🟦 *Fair teams: how it works*
Once the squad's locked in, any admin can tag me and ask for the teams (for example *@Match Time generate the teams*) and I'll split everyone into two balanced sides using their form ratings, so games stay even.
I post the line-ups straight into the chat. Not happy with a pairing? Tag me and say what to change, in your own words (e.g. _"@Match Time swap Sam and Alex"_), or ask me to show the teams again any time.
Want a bit of fun? Ask me to give the teams names and I'll sort it. Just tag me and ask when you're ready.

✅ It's on for this club.

### R142 buildHelpReply / mom
🏆 *Man of the Match: how it works*
After the final whistle I post a quick *Man of the Match* vote in the group. Everyone just taps who they thought was the standout player.
I tally the votes, announce the winner, and it counts towards everyone's season stats, so the MoM race builds up over the year.
Nothing to set up: I'll start the vote myself once the game's done. Ask me for your MoM tally any time, in your own words (for example *@Match Time my stats*).

✅ It's on for this club.

### R142 buildHelpReply / ratings
⭐ *Player ratings: how it works*
After each match I DM every player who turned out a private link. You rate the other players out of 10 (you can't rate yourself, and your scores stay private).
I combine everyone's scores into a form rating for each player at this club, updated after every game, and that is what I use to build *balanced teams*. Ratings stay inside the club: if you also play for another group, their scores never touch this one. So the more people rate, the fairer the teams.
You'll get the link the morning after the game. Ask me for yours any time, in your own words (for example *@Match Time my stats*).

✅ It's on for this club.

### R142 buildHelpReply / reminders
⏰ *Reminders: how it works*
I gently nudge anyone who hasn't said *In* or *Out* yet, then remind the whole squad before kick-off so nobody forgets.
Want a personal nudge? Tag me and say when, in your own words (for example *"@Match Time remind me Thursday"*), and I'll DM you then.
It all happens automatically, so you don't need to chase anyone yourself.

✅ It's on for this club.

### R142 buildHelpReply / payments
ℹ️ This isn't switched on for this group yet, but here's how it works.

💷 *Match fees: how it works*
After each game I ask your money collector for the fee per player, then DM everyone who played a link to pay their share, by card or bank. The money goes straight to the money collector's bank.
I chase anyone who hasn't paid with a daily reminder, so nobody has to chase their mates for cash.
Paid in cash or by transfer instead? The player tells me *"paid"* and I ask the money collector to confirm it landed.

🔧 To switch it on, an admin turns on *Collect match fees* on the settings page, picks the money collector, then connects their bank with Stripe once (about 2 minutes):
https://matchtime.ai/admin/settings#payments
Admins: DM me *help payments* and I'll send you a link that signs you straight in.

