### R144 rating_club_tile
Club rating

### R144 rating_club_label
Your rating at Sutton Football Club

### R144 rating_club_note
From this club's ratings only. Other clubs never count here.

### R144 rating_club_empty
No ratings at this club yet. Your team-mates set this after your first game.

### R144 rating_club_provisional / one
Provisional: 1 rating so far, so this number will move a lot as more arrive.

### R144 rating_club_provisional / two
Provisional: 2 ratings so far, so this number will move a lot as more arrive.

### R144 rating_club_balance_note
While you have only a rating or two, MatchTime is careful with it when picking teams, so one early score does not decide a side.

### R144 rating_club_peers / one
1 peer rating

### R144 rating_club_peers / many
24 peer ratings

### R145 rating_overall_label
Your overall rating

### R145 rating_overall_note
Every rating you have ever had, from every club, counted once each. Only you can see this.

### R146 rating_seed_club_hint
Seed ratings apply to this club only. A player who also turns out somewhere else keeps a separate rating there, and nothing you type here changes it.

