### R188 club fee tip / 5-a-side, GBP 8 example
💷 *Club fee tip:* MatchTime only charges for the games you play, up to £9.99 a month. Each game played costs the club at most £2.50, which is about *25p a player per game* for your 10 players. If your game costs £8 each, charge *£8.25* and the club fee is covered. Weeks you don't play cost nothing.

