### R136 buildLegacySetupIntro
👋 *Hey, I'm MatchTime*, the automatic organiser for your football group. I take the weekly admin off your hands so you can just turn up and play.

Here's what I do:
⚽ *Attendance:* players just say "in" or "out" right here; I keep the squad list live and chase the stragglers
⚖️ *Fair teams:* auto-balanced sides every week from real player ratings
🪑 *Smart bench:* squad full? I offer the spot to the whole bench, first to claim it plays. Nobody's ever dropped for being asleep
🏆 *Man of the Match & ratings:* a quick post-match vote and a one-tap rating link, no app to install
⏰ *Reminders & stats:* "@MatchTime remind me Thursday", or ask me "who got MoM last week?"

No spreadsheets, no chasing, no admin headaches. ⚡

Let's get you set up, it takes about a minute:

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / name
👋 Let's get MatchTime set up for this group! First, what should I call your club/group? (e.g. *Thursday Ballers*)

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / players per side
Great, *Tuesday Ballers FC* it is. How many players per side? (e.g. *7* for 7-a-side, *5* for 5-a-side)

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / day
Which *day of the week* do you usually play? (e.g. Thursday)

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / time
What *kickoff time*? (e.g. 9:30pm)

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / venue
Where do you play? The *venue* name, please.

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / recurrence
Is this a *weekly* fixture or a *one-off* match?

### R137 legacyEventQuestion / one-off date
What *date* is the one-off match? (e.g. 2026-05-28)

### R139 buildLegacyFeatureMenu / provisioned
Nice, *Tuesday Ballers FC* is set up for *7-a-side* on *Tuesdays 21:00* at *Goals Wembley*.

Last step: which features do you want? Here's everything I can do:

1. *Attendance tracking*: Reads IN/OUT messages, keeps the squad list, chases when short.
2. *Bench management*: Runs the bench; when someone drops, asks the next bencher to step up.
3. *Team generation*: Builds two balanced teams on request.
4. *Man of the Match*: Announces the winner in the group. Players vote on their rating link.
5. *Player ratings*: DMs each player a quick post-match rating link.
6. *Personal reminders*: "@MatchTime remind me Monday" and the bot DMs you then.
7. *Stats answers*: Answers history questions (top attenders, past MoMs, scores).
8. *Collect match fees (Stripe)*: After each match, DM each player a link to pay. Needs a connected bank (below).
9. *  ↳ Pay by Bank*: Cheapest way to pay by link: £10.36 on a £10 fee. The recommended default.
10. *  ↳ Card and Apple Pay*: Card, Apple Pay or Google Pay: £10.46 on a £10 fee.
11. *  ↳ Pay organiser directly*: Cash/transfer; the money collector confirms receipt. No fee.

Reply with the ones you want, e.g. "Man of the Match and player ratings", "everything", or "all except payments".

