### LRN1 composeSetupDm / every setting switched, a kickoff time worth a check
I read the recent messages in "Thursday Ladies 5s" to see how it runs, and set MatchTime up the same way.

✅ *Rolling squad is on:* whoever played last time is in next time, unless they say OUT.
From messages like: "Same lot as last week"
Undo or change: https://matchtime.ai/r/u1

✅ *Drop-out deadline:* Monday 21:00. MatchTime reminds the group before it.
From messages like: "Drop out by Monday 9pm"
Undo or change: https://matchtime.ai/r/u3

✅ *Final list:* posted in the group on Tuesday at 20:00.
From messages like: "Final list goes up Tuesday at 8pm"
Undo or change: https://matchtime.ai/r/u4

✅ *Payment tracking is on:* MatchTime keeps track of who has paid and sends a friendly reminder to anyone who hasn't.
From messages like: "sent £6"
Undo or change: https://matchtime.ai/r/u5

Worth a check (I changed nothing here):
🔎 The chat says kickoff is at 20:00; your weekly game is set for 19:00.
🔎 The chat talks about games on Wednesday; your weekly game is on Thursday.
🔎 The chat names Mabley Green as the pitch; your weekly game says Hackney Marshes.
🔎 The chat talks about 6 a side; your weekly game is 5 a side.
🔎 The chat is mostly in Turkish; MatchTime speaks English in this group.
Change it here: https://matchtime.ai/r/sched
🔎 It looks like the organisers choose who fills an open place. If that's right, switch on "The organisers pick".
From messages like: "Drop me a message"
Switch it on here: https://matchtime.ai/r/pick

Everything is on your settings page, with the chat messages behind each one: https://matchtime.ai/r/settings

### LRN2 composeSetupDm / a monthly list noted, nothing switched
I read the recent messages in "Old Boys Monday" to see how it runs. I didn't change any settings, but a few things are worth a look.

📋 I also noticed a monthly list: regulars sign up and pay for the month, others pay as they go to fill spaces and a game a regular misses becomes credit. MatchTime has a monthly squad mode for groups like this. I haven't switched it on: you can do that in Settings, under Monthly squad, if you want it. Until you do, nothing changed for it, and I left payment tracking off because it works game by game.

Everything is on your settings page, with the chat messages behind each one: https://matchtime.ai/r/settings

